00:40:21.145 --> 00:40:22.083
Security.

800
00:40:22.363 --> 00:40:34.886
JWT validated at the gateway, order ownership checked at the pod, no PII in event payloads beyond coarse rider location near the destination, and location updates stop at delivery.

801
00:40:36.236 --> 00:40:36.940
