Run L1, then change the poll interval to 50 ms and 1 s and record wasted requests and worst-case delay.

1477
01:24:00.675 --> 01:24:01.358
Hint:

1478
01:24:01.638 --> 01:24:03.473
The two trade off against each other.

1479
01:24:03.753 --> 01:24:04.585
B1.

1480
01:24:04.865 --> 01:24:05.931
Exercise:

1481
