1485
01:24:16.633 --> 01:24:26.745
Measure a cold versus warm HTTPS request with curl -w %timeconnect %timeappconnect %timestarttransfer\n.

1486
01:24:27.025 --> 01:24:27.707
Hint:

1487
01:24:27.987 --> 01:24:29.737
Run the same URL twice.

1488
01:24:30.017 --> 01:24:30.891
B2.

1489
01:24:31.171 --> 01:24:32.238
Exercise:

1490
01:24:32.518 --> 01:24:40.710
Add a client-side watchdog to a Java SSE client that reconnects with Last-Event-ID after 45 s of silence.

1491
01:24:40.990 --> 01:24:41.673
Hint:

1492
01:24:41.953 --> 01:24:43.574
Track the last id seen.

1493
01:24:43.854 --> 01:24:44.729
B3.

1494
01:24:45.009 --> 01:24:46.075
Exercise:

1495
01:24:46.355 --> 01:24:51.475
Put NGINX in front of L3 with buffering on, observe the batching, then fix it.

1496
