B3.

1498
01:24:55.839 --> 01:24:56.905
Exercise:

1499
01:24:57.185 --> 01:25:02.689
Load test 20 K concurrent SSE streams on one pod and chart memory per stream.

1500
01:25:02.969 --> 01:25:05.743
Hint: k6 or Gatling SSE support.

1501
01:25:06.023 --> 01:25:06.897
B4.

1502
01:25:07.177 --> 01:25:08.244
